--[[
    ============================================================
      NEBULA HUB  -  Neon Galactic Liquid-Glass Movement GUI
    ============================================================
      Combined client script:
        - Draggable, rounded, animated "liquid glass" window
        - Teleport Walk (adjustable distance)
        - FOV control (increases field of view)
        - Rainbow glowing Base Beam with scrolling "soundwave" texture
        - Press [Q] to warp to the end of the beam:
              fling there (capped at 62 speed),
              orbit the beam end for 1 second,
              then unfling + kick the player.

      HOW TO RUN:
        Paste into your executor, OR place as a LocalScript inside
        StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts.

      NOTES:
        - To change the beam into a real audio "soundwave" line, swap
          CONFIG.BeamTexture for any waveform texture id from the Toolbox
          (search "sound wave" / "waveform"). The scroll animation makes
          it flow back toward your base no matter which texture you use.
        - Don't want to get kicked at the end of the warp? Delete the
          single player:Kick(...) line in PHASE 3 below.
    ============================================================
]]

